For any web design, redesign, animation or critique task, follow the skill at `skills/asfakulsiam-motomation-design/SKILL.md`
(or `.agents/skills/asfakulsiam-motomation-design/SKILL.md` when installed with `npx skills add`).
Define the product contract first (`thinking/product-contract.md`), research and synthesise the direction (Thinking Sequence) before writing UI code, set the three dials, pick the lowest motion tier that delivers the concept,
and pass the Delivery Gate before handing back. Never ship the AI-default look. Read `gates/rules.md` before designing,
research the exact product type and the design landscape (Steps 1–2, `craft/research.md`); opinions are advisory and recipes optional (`principles/authority.md`), and ship `DESIGN.md` with `SCHEMA.md` (`templates/SCHEMA.md`).
